@baseUrl = http://localhost:8325
@userId = expo-user-001
@deviceId = expo-device-001
@journalId = 替换为晚安卡 UUID

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Prometheus 指标（不在 /api/v1 下）
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### 获取设置
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 部分更新设置；提醒由 Android 本地调度
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "bedtime": "23:00",
  "wakeTime": "07:30",
  "persona": "gentle",
  "defaultGuidance": "breathing_46",
  "whiteNoiseDurationMin": 20,
  "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai",
  "bedtimeReminderEnabled": true,
  "wakeAlarmEnabled": true
}

### 获取今晚状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tonight
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 仅跳过今晚提醒
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tonight/actions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"action":"skip_tonight_reminders"}

### 模拟闭仓
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tonight/actions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"action":"simulate_box_closed"}

### 开始倾诉
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tonight/actions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"action":"start_conversation"}

### 上报正在说话，延长静默截止
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/activity
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"activity":"speaking"}

### Debug 文字倾诉；正式产品语音由 T5 Voice WebSocket 完成
# clientRequestId 重试时保持不变。HTTP 示例不演示 binary PCM WebSocket，
# 设备协议见 docs/hardware-integration.md 和 docs/voice-streaming-design.md。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/turn
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"text":"明天要做工作汇报，我有点紧张。","inputMode":"text","clientRequestId":"{{$uuid}}"}

### APP 重启后恢复完整对话
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/tonight
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 提前结束倾诉
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/finalize
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 选择白噪音；命令包含 Profile 配置的 durationMinutes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tonight/actions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"action":"select_guidance","guidance":"rain"}

### 最近 7 张晚安卡
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/journals?limit=7
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 单卡详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/journals/{{journalId}}
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 完成明日待办
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/journals/{{journalId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"tomorrowTaskCompleted":true}

### 删除历史单卡及对应当晚对话；进行中的今晚返回 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/journals/{{journalId}}
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 设备 heartbeat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/device/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId":"{{deviceId}}",
  "userId":"{{userId}}",
  "firmwareVersion":"1.1.0",
  "capabilities":{"voiceWebSocket":true,"pcm24000Mono":true,"sunrise":true,"builtInGuidance":["rain","brown_noise"]},
  "status":{"boxClosed":true}
}

### APP 查询设备状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/status
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 设备事件；同 eventId 重试返回 duplicate=true
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/device/events
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{$uuid}}","deviceId":"{{deviceId}}","userId":"{{userId}}","type":"box_opened","payload":{}}

### 重复闭仓状态；即使使用新 eventId，也返回 200 且 commands=[]，不重复确认音
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/device/events
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{$uuid}}","deviceId":"{{deviceId}}","userId":"{{userId}}","type":"box_closed","payload":{}}

### 领取设备命令；关注 attempt 与 leaseExpiresAt，并按 id 去重
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/device/commands/next?deviceId={{deviceId}}&timeoutSec=1

### Android 状态 WebSocket（仅 JSON 事件）
WS {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ws?userId={{userId}}

### T5 Voice WebSocket
# 地址：ws://localhost:8325/api/v1/device/voice?deviceId={{deviceId}}&userId={{userId}}
# 控制帧为 JSON text；音频帧为 24kHz/16-bit/mono/20ms、960-byte binary PCM。
# 普通 .http 示例不适合表达二进制时序，请按 docs/hardware-integration.md 实现。
